    <statement><p>Evaluate the definite integral</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle \int_{ 3 } ^ { 7 } (12x^{2}-2x+8) dx =</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{12}{3}\cdot 7^{3}-\frac{2}{2}\cdot 7^{2}+8\cdot 7-\left(\frac{12}{3}\cdot 3^{3}-\frac{2}{2}\cdot 3^{2}+8\cdot 3\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
